{"step_index":129,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T01:54:09Z","thinking":"The provided business IDs, `7611000012` and `7632801045`, have been verified as \"폐업자\" (closed businesses) by the external data source. The data source also indicates the 폐업 (closure) status format. Now, cross-referencing this against the user input is the next step.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nasync function test() {\n  const t0 = Date.now();\n  const testBiznos = ['7601400870', '7601501084', '7606400410', '7608700059', '7610401908', '7610701383', '7611000012', '7617400052', '7618700130', '7618701110'];\n  const results = await Promise.all(testBiznos.map(async b => {\n    const res = await fetch('https://bizno.net/article/' + b, { headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0' } });\n    return { b, status: res.status, ok: res.ok };\n  }));\n  console.log('Done 10 in', Date.now() - t0, 'ms');\n  console.log(results);\n}\ntest().catch(console.error);\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\verify_and_update_db","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Testing batch fetch","toolSummary":"Batch fetch 10 companies"}}]}
