{"step_index":131,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T01:54:17Z","thinking":"That speed and reliability are promising. Initiating a field-by-field examination of the ten companies' data to construct a robust parser for the Bizno data format. Focusing on extracting and validating company name, business status, representative, zip code, address, phone, and fax. Creating a test script to systematically check the parsing of each field across all sample entries.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nfunction parseBizno(html, bizno) {\n  const data = {\n    bizno,\n    company: '',\n    status: '',\n    statusDesc: '',\n    ceo: '',\n    zip: '',\n    addr: '',\n    tel: '',\n    fax: '',\n    homepage: '',\n    email: '',\n    corpNo: '',\n    entityType: '',\n    employees: '',\n    catLarge: '',\n    catMid: '',\n    catSmall: '',\n    industry: ''\n  };\n\n  const titleMatch = html.match(/<title>(.*?)<\\/title>/i);\n  if (titleMatch) data.company = titleMatch[1].trim();\n\n  const thTdMatches = [...html.matchAll(/<th[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/th>[\\s\\S]*?<td[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/td>/gi)];\n  for (const m of thTdMatches) {\n    const k = m[1].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim();\n    const v = m[2].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim();\n    if (!k) continue;\n\n    if (k.includes('사업자 현재 상태')) {\n      data.statusDesc = v.replace(/\\s+/g, ' ');\n      if (v.includes('폐업')) data.status = '폐업';\n      else if (v.includes('휴업')) data.status = '휴업';\n      else data.status = '';\n    } else if (k === '대표자명') {\n      data.ceo = v.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim();\n      if (data.ceo === '-') data.ceo = '';\n    } else if (k === '우편번호') {\n      const cleanZip = v.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n      if (cleanZip.length === 5) data.zip = cleanZip;\n    } else if (k === '회사주소') {\n      // Often contains road address followed by parcel address\n      // e.g. '부산광역시 강서구 생곡산단로61번길 17부산광역시 강서구 생곡동 1534-2'\n      // Or separated by newline in innerHTML\n      const lines = m[2].replace(/<br\\s*\\/?>/gi, '\\n').replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').split('\\n').map(l => l.trim()).filter(l => l);\n      data.addr = lines[0] || v;\n    } else if (k === '전화번호') {\n      data.tel = v;\n    } else if (k === '팩스번호') {\n      data.fax = v;\n    } else if (k === '홈페이지') {\n      data.homepage = v;\n    } else if (k === '회사이메일') {\n      data.email = v;\n    } else if (k === '법인등록번호') {\n      const c = v.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n      if (c.length === 13) {\n        data.corpNo = c.slice(0, 6) + '-' + c.slice(6);\n      }\n    } else if (k === '법인형태') {\n      data.entityType = v;\n    } else if (k === '종업원수') {\n      data.employees = v;\n    } else if (k === '종목') {\n      data.industry = v;\n    } else if (k.includes('국세청산업분류')) {\n      const lm = v.match(/대분류\\s*:\\s*([^중소세\\n]+)/);\n      const mm = v.match(/중분류\\s*:\\s*([^대소세\\n]+)/);\n      const sm = v.match(/소분류\\s*:\\s*([^대중세\\n]+)/);\n      if (lm) data.catLarge = lm[1].trim();\n      if (mm) data.catMid = mm[1].trim();\n      if (sm) data.catSmall = sm[1].trim();\n    }\n  }\n  return data;\n}\n\nasync function test() {\n  const testBiznos = ['7601400870', '7601501084', '7606400410', '7608700059', '7610401908', '7610701383', '7611000012', '7617400052', '7618700130', '7618701110'];\n  for (const b of testBiznos) {\n    const res = await fetch('https://bizno.net/article/' + b, { headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0' } });\n    const html = await res.text();\n    const d = parseBizno(html, b);\n    console.log(d.bizno, d.company, '| status:', d.status || '정상', '| ceo:', d.ceo, '| zip:', d.zip, '| corpNo:', d.corpNo, '| cat:', d.catLarge, '/', d.catMid, '/', d.catSmall);\n  }\n}\ntest().catch(console.error);\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\verify_and_update_db","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Testing parsed fields","toolSummary":"Verify parsed fields for sample"}}]}
