{"step_index":153,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T01:55:29Z","thinking":"Checking if the system remembers the `db취합전달용.xlsx` file; the prompt suggests data validation and potential modifications to the provided information. The provided snippet requires parsing and interpretation of the data, potentially involving name, company, and contact details. It's necessary to determine the structure and purpose of this data for appropriate handling.\n\n\nIdentifying that the Excel file contains 200 businesses located in rows 19201 to 19400. The verification process needs to begin by fact-checking each business against the listed criteria. It will involve verifying the business status, restoring masked names, validating legal entity registration numbers, updating postal codes, standardizing addresses, and normalizing phone/fax numbers.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"node -e \"\nconst fs = require('fs');\nconst lines = fs.readFileSync('input_user_raw.txt', 'utf-8').trim().split('\\n').filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\nconsole.log('Count:', lines.length);\nlines.forEach((l, idx) => {\n  const parts = l.split('\\t');\n  const b = (parts[3] || '').replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\n  const comp = parts[2]?.trim();\n  // check first 5 and last 5\n  if (idx < 5 || idx >= lines.length - 5) {\n    console.log(\\`[\\${idx + 1}] Row in Excel \\${19201 + idx}: \\${comp} (\\${b})\\`);\n  }\n});\n\"","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\worktrees\\resilient-bardeen\\verify_and_update_db","IsDaemon":false,"WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Verifying row alignment","toolSummary":"Check 1-to-1 row alignment"}}]}
